  "primary": "A zone at the aim point with a 2-block radius for 3 s. Every second, on everyone inside except you:\n• Damage 1.25 ❤ fire + 1.25 ❤ earth (fire ×0.5 on wet, earth ×2 on frozen)\n• Heat: sets on fire for 6 s (wet targets just dry off), thaws; melts ice and burns roots\n• Cold 40: extinguishes and slows, freezes for 4 s at 100 built-up cold (×2.5 on wet); puddles freeze\n• If the target is frozen or brittle: damage 4.75 ❤ thermal\n• Light push\n• Blocks within 2 blocks turn brittle for 8 s\n• Withering: −0.5 ❤ per second for 4 s\n• Life drain: 0.5 ❤ damage, you heal 0.2 ❤",
